description=Smart DNS filtering with DNSCrypt. Local resolver on 127.0.0.1:5354, per-profile blocklists (HaGeZi Light/Normal/PRO/PRO++/Ultimate), wildcard-aware Custom Rules (Allowlist + Denylist), bilingual WebUI (AR/EN), separate monitoring Dashboard with JSON metrics, SSE live status, atomic writes, content-hash conflict detection, Watchdog with auto-restart, iptables/ip6tables/nftables Custom Chains, installable PWA. Zero telemetry.
